    "description": "Stream all seasons of The Chosen in our OFFICIAL app. Don\u2019t miss our app exclusives\u2014the Aftershow, Bible Roundtables, and behind-the-scenes extras\u2014found only here.\r\n\r\nCome and see for yourself\u2014witness the ground-breaking historical drama about the life of Jesus, seen through the eyes of those who knew Him. Set against the backdrop of Roman oppression in first-century Israel, this multi-season show shares an authentic and intimate look at Jesus\u2019 revolutionary life and teachings.\r\n\r\nWatch all seasons now. Stream on your iPhone, iPad, or cast to your TV \u2014 nothing required!\r\n\r\nAnd when you finish the seasons, there\u2019s more. Enjoy lots of app exclusives\u2014our Aftershow, Bible Roundtables, and behind-the-scenes extras\u2014found only here.",
